@startuml
title Admin: change the puzzle selection strategy

actor Admin
participant "Admin GUI (PySide6)" as GUI
participant AdminApiServer as API
participant ConfigService as Cfg
participant TrainerService as Svc
participant TrainerBridge as Br

Admin -> GUI: set selector = Random, Save
GUI -> API: PUT /config (X-Admin-Token)
API -> API: pre-routing token check (else 401)
API -> Cfg: apply(patch)
Cfg -> Cfg: validate (known selector, ranges, ports differ)
alt invalid
  Cfg --> API: errors
  API --> GUI: 400 + errors
else valid
  Cfg -> Cfg: write config.json (QSaveFile)
  Cfg -> Svc: listener: setSelector, setRatingWindow
  Svc -> Svc: create selector via SelectorRegistry (under mutex)
  Svc -> Br: change listener (queued to the GUI thread)
  Cfg --> API: ConfigResult (restartRequired)
  API --> GUI: 200 + config
end
Br -> Br: refreshStats; QML shows the new strategy
GUI --> Admin: show updated values
@enduml